# Candidate face detectors evaluated for bench.ts and not shipped.
# Zero references in source: the model that ships is YuNet, vendored into
# public/models/ by `npm run vendor:model` and gitignored above. Committing
# 24 MB of weights the build never reads while ignoring the ones it does would
# be exactly backwards. The files stay on disk; only the repo skips them.
/*.onnx

